        <mxCell id="rgP4XJpEU2pRbP7EMXJJ-92" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap" value="SPDX Relationship Types:&#xa;• STATIC_LINK — .a/.o code embedded at build time&#xa;• DYNAMIC_LINK — .so loaded at runtime&#xa;• BUILD_TOOL_OF — gcc, ld used during build&#xa;• CONTAINS — source files in the binary" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="240" x="771" y="870" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rgP4XJpEU2pRbP7EMXJJ-93" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=0" value="SECTION 3 DATA FLOW:&#xa;1. AdgParser reads ADG, uses bomsh_omnibor_treedb&#xa;   to resolve gitoid hashes → file paths&#xa;   Output: static_inputs[] (list of .o/.a paths)&#xa;&#xa;2. VendoredVersionDetector scans source directories&#xa;   for version strings (configure.ac, headers)&#xa;   Output: pkg_versions{} (name → version map)&#xa;&#xa;3. collect_dynamic_libs.py runs ldd on each binary,&#xa;   then dpkg -S to find apt packages&#xa;   Output: dyn_libs[] (pkg name, version, .so path)&#xa;&#xa;4. SpdxEmitter produces TWO SBOMs per binary:&#xa;   Build SBOM: source files + compiler from interception&#xa;   Analyzed SBOM: build + dynamic libs, system pkgs,&#xa;     PURLs, CPEs — the complete picture&#xa;&#xa;5. spdx_visualize.py generates interactive D3.js&#xa;   force-directed graphs for both SBOMs" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="240" x="771" y="990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rgP4XJpEU2pRbP7EMXJJ-94" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="     collect_dynamic_libs.py&#xa;&#xa;Runs: ldd &lt;binary&gt;&#xa;Parses output to get .so paths:&#xa;→ /lib/x86_64.../libc.so.6&#xa;→ /usr/lib/.../libcurl.so.4&#xa;&#xa;Runs: dpkg -S &lt;path&gt;&#xa;Maps each .so → apt package&#xa;+ version:&#xa;→ libc6: /lib/.../libc.so.6&#xa;dpkg -s libc6 → ver 2.35" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="133" x="157" y="1067" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
